<title>LATVIA: RIGA CARRIAGE MAKER PUBLIC OFFER AUGUST 15.</title>
<headline>RIGA CARRIAGE MAKER PUBLIC OFFER AUGUST 15.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Latvian Privatisation agency (LPA) said on Thursday it has set the quota of the Riga railway carriage factory shares to be sold on public offer for vouchers.</p>
<p>The LPA said in a statement that 26.38 percent or 1.43 million shares will be on offer for privatisation vouchers and the subscription will start on August 15.</p>
<p>The company's controlling stake of 50.11 percent or 2.71 million shares was auctioned earlier in June to Latek, a local company, for 16.06 million lats.</p>
<p>-- Riga newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
